    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy won't change the fact that there is no version of my life where i get to be me. the walls are too high. everyone expects me to be this perfect person and if i'm not, everything falls apart. it's not a \"perspective\" issue, it's just how my world is. i feel like i'm drowning in their lives and i'll never reach the surface. it just feels like there's no way out.",
