      "content": "but there's no peace in this. there's no \"self-assertion\" when you have to perform every single day just to exist. it's constant. i'm just waiting for my life to start and it's never gonna start. i actually find myself thinking that the only real way to get any peace... the only way to actually be free of all this weight and finally have some control... is to just leave it all behind. like, permanently. to just stop.",
